# Trust invariants (MTG image cascade)

## Division of responsibility

- **Library** (`mtg_card_recognition`): propose candidates, zones, embeddings, OCR text.
- **Consumer** (`mtg_ebay_workflows/candidates/`): row policy, `evidence_json`, pricing eligibility, single winner per listing.

## Verification

- Set `image_verified=true` only when `image_verification_source` is `set_collector` or `set_symbol`.
- FAISS similarity, art embedding, or title OCR alone **must not** verify a printing for pricing.

## Pricing

- At most **one** pricing-eligible winner per listing after gate selection.
- Bulk lots: no title-only pricing for lot rows without crop-level gate pass.

## Persistence

- Persist `model_version` on detections when detector changes (e.g. `yolo_obb_v1_*`).
- Do not log secrets, tokens, or raw eBay credentials.
